(3, 'niaz-mahmud-appupnext.jpg', 'Niaz Mahmud', 'niaz-mahmud', '<p>I work closely with vloggers, brands, and content creators using industry-standard tools like Adobe Premiere Pro and After Effects. If you\'re looking to create scroll-stopping content that drives views and grows your channel &mdash; let&rsquo;s connect!&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', 'I’m Niaz — a skilled video editor with over 1 year of experience specializing in YouTube videos, Reels, TikToks, and Shorts. I create fast-paced, engaging content with smooth cuts, on-screen captions, professional color grading, and sound design.', NULL, NULL, '<p>I work closely with vloggers, brands, and content creators using industry-standard tools like Adobe Premiere Pro and After Effects. If you\'re looking to create scroll-stopping content that drives views and grows your channel &mdash; let&rsquo;s connect!&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '<p>I work closely with vloggers, brands, and content creators using industry-standard tools like Adobe Premiere Pro and After Effects. If you\'re looking to create scroll-stopping content that drives views and grows your channel &mdash; let&rsquo;s connect!&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '0', '1', '2024-02-27 03:06:51', '2025-06-02 04:26:32'),
(4, 'shuvo-rt-appupnext.jpg', 'Shuvo Rt', 'shuvo-rt', '<p>helping businesses and individuals bring their ideas to life through eye-catching visuals.</p>\r\n<p>From bold Facebook ads and clean logo designs to stunning Instagram posts,</p>', 'I’m Shuvo Rt  a passionate and detail-oriented freelance graphic designer with 1+ years of experience', NULL, NULL, '<p>helping businesses and individuals bring their ideas to life through eye-catching visuals.</p>\r\n<p>From bold Facebook ads and clean logo designs to stunning Instagram posts,</p>', '<p>helping businesses and individuals bring their ideas to life through eye-catching visuals.</p>\r\n<p>From bold Facebook ads and clean logo designs to stunning Instagram posts,</p>', '0', '1', '2024-02-27 03:07:09', '2025-10-26 08:53:22'),
(8, 'abdur-rahman-isha-appupnext.jpg', 'Abdur Rahman Isha', 'abdur-rahman-isha', '<h1 class=\"card-title text-dark font-weight-bold mb-0\" style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / .5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: -0.022rem; font-family: Inter, \'sans-serif\'; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 2rem; --geeks-text-opacity: 1; background-color: #ffffff; color: #0f172a !important; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal;\">&nbsp;Each of these ventures reflects his commitment to providing premium services and products, spanning web development, digital marketing, e-commerce, and more. Through his leadership, these brands have garnered worldwide recognition, and Isha continues to drive forward with a passion for technology and business innovation.</span></h1>', 'Abdur Rahman Isha built a global digital solutions empire with a vision to empower businesses worldwide. With a focus on cutting-edge technology and innovation, he also founded several successful platforms, including EnvatoMonster, EnvatoThemes, EnvatoLab, EnvatoMarket, ThemeWorlds, ThemeLab, BodyFt, and 1Bajar', NULL, NULL, '<h1 class=\"card-title text-dark font-weight-bold mb-0\" style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 / .5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 